---
description: Prepare one interpretBrief evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: MenuProject[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Translate the culinary brief into desired experience, service style, supplied dietary requirements, equipment, and budget constraints. Distinguish preferences from mandatory restrictions and use only verified ingredient and allergen information rather than inferring safety from a dish name. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
